# Cobra mark — 16x16 pixel art, front-facing hooded cobra.
# Single source of truth: Scripts/make-icon.py renders this into both the
# .icns app icon and the Swift menu bar glyph, so the two cannot drift.
#
#   .  transparent
#   #  body      (venom green)
#   o  eye       (knocked out, so the dark tile shows through)
#   ~  tongue    (danger red)
#
# The eyes are 2x2 rather than single pixels: at menu bar size a one-pixel eye
# disappears and the silhouette stops reading as a face.
